# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# The ICM-42607 IMU has no known interrupt line, so it samples on an IIO
# hrtimer trigger. The mainline sensors HAL picks up "<iio name>-trigger" by
# itself and sets its rate, so it needs no configfs access of its own.
on post-fs
    mkdir /config/iio/triggers/hrtimer/icm42607-trigger
